* Each .product-card { flex:0 0 calc(25% - 12px) }
* .img-wrap { position:relative; overflow:hidden }
* <img display:block; width:100%; height:auto; transition:transform 0.45s ease> — :hover transform:scale(1.04)
* Optional .product-tag { position:absolute; top:10px; left:10px; background:#000; color:#fff; font-size:9px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; padding:3px 8px }
* .product-info { padding:10px 0 0 }
* .product-name { font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.02em; margin-bottom:4px }
* .product-price { font-size:12px; color:#666 }
* Font: proxima-nova throughout

### Responsive
* @media (max-width:767px): .product-card flex:0 0 calc(50% - 8px)

