redirects/WebMultiPanelSectionNav.html:
Create a tab nav with animated underline that switches content panels using vanilla JavaScript.

### Structure
* .section-nav { display:flex; gap:32px; justify-content:center; border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0; margin-bottom:32px }
* .nav-link { color:#999; font-family:proxima-nova; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; padding-bottom:12px; position:relative; cursor:pointer }
* .nav-link.active { color:#000 }
* .nav-link::after { content:''; position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; width:100%; height:1px; background:#000; transform:scaleX(0); transform-origin:left; transition:transform 0.25s ease }
* .nav-link.active::after { transform:scaleX(1) }
* .panel { display:none }
* .panel.active { display:block }

### Behaviour
* Clicking .nav-link removes .active from all nav-links and panels, adds .active to the clicked nav-link and matching panel by index or data-target attribute

